 "context": "<div data-type=\"note\" data-has-label=\"true\" id=\"fs-idm185889136\" class=\"interactive-embedded-reading\" data-label=\"\">\n<div data-type=\"title\">Link to Learning</div>\n    <span data-type=\"media\" id=\"fs-idp125430800\" data-alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\">\n        <img src=\"https://openstax.org/apps/archive/20241024.164013/resources/80ec1d1688586afe5b81446cb7f26d1234396f4e\" data-media-type=\"image/png\" alt=\"QR Code representing a URL\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\">\n    </span>\n    <p id=\"fs-idm63648336\">Watch this video explaining how a muscle contraction is signaled.\n\n</p>\n<div data-type=\"media\" id=\"eip-id4815428\" data-alt=\"contract_muscle\">\n<div class=\"os-has-iframe os-has-link\" data-type=\"switch\">\n<a class=\"os-is-link\" href=\"https://openstax.org/books/biology/pages/38-4-muscle-contraction-and-locomotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" data-media=\"print\">Access multimedia content</a>\n<iframe width=\"660\" height=\"371.4\" src=\"https://www.openstaxcollege.org/l/contract_muscle\" class=\"os-is-iframe\" data-media=\"screen\"><!-- no-selfclose --></iframe>\n</div>\n                 </div>\n</div>\n",
